  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Mozambique&apos;s Municipal(2013) and General(2014) Elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase transparency and participation in municipal and general elections by strengthening civil society engagement in electoral processes through focused civic education activities and elections observation. This will benefit the people of Mozambique and contribute to more transparent and credible municipal and general elections through better knowledge of electoral laws and impartial observation of electoral processes. This will make it more likely that election results are accepted by all political parties involved and that the risk of political tension escalating to violence is mitigated.</narrative>
  </description>
